{%- doc -%}
  Outputs true when the signed-in customer may only order the first variant of a product.
  This applies to B2B customers, whose company locations are assigned the Virksomheder or Engros catalog.
  Liquid can't read a catalog's name, so every B2B customer counts.
  For these customers the variant picker is hidden and the first variant is always the one sold.

  @example
  {% capture first_variant_only %}{% render 'first-variant-only' %}{% endcapture %}
{%- enddoc -%}

{%- if customer.b2b? -%}true{%- endif -%}
